nk": 75, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 76, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "tile_size"}, "name": "tile_size", "label": "tile_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "overlap"}, "name": "overlap", "label": "overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "overlap"}], "flags": {}, "id": 53, "type": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [83, 86], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [335.28955078125, 473.9073486328125], "pos": [2248.224853515625, 1636.832275390625], "widgets_values": ["**Global Metadata:**\nGenre: Pop Rock / Power Ballad\nSubgenre: Emotional Rock\nTempo: 82 BPM\nKey / Scale: C Major\nMood: 撕心裂肺、充满张力、深情且狂野\nEmotional Progression: 压抑叙述 → 纠缠对峙 → 情感爆发 → 凄美余韵\nOverall Style: 2000年代经典华语摇滚情歌，电影质感，充满力量感\n\n**Vocal Details:**\nLead Vocal: 男女对唱\nVocal Range: 女声（高音域，极具穿透力），男声（中低音域，沙哑厚实）\nTimbre: 女声清澈嘹亮且带有一丝颗粒感；男声粗糙沙哑，充满故事感与沧桑感\nDelivery: 充满戏剧张力的对唱，副歌处两人情感交织碰撞\nVerse Vocal: 两人交替叙述，克制且深情\nChorus Vocal: 两人合唱与高音对飙，充满爆发力\nBacking Vocals: 远处的空灵吟唱，副歌加入厚实的和声墙\nVocal Effects: 适度的 Reverb 营造空间感，突出声线的原始质感\n\n**Arrangement:**\n\nIntro:\n孤独的钢琴单音起头，随后加入低沉的电吉他滑音，营造出一种冷冽的氛围\n\nVerse 1:\n男声低沉诉说，伴随极简的钢琴伴奏，鼓点轻微敲击\n\nPre-Chorus:\n女声切入，乐器密度逐渐增加，加入微弱的弦乐铺底，情绪开始蓄力\n\nChorus:\n全乐器进入，激昂的失真电吉他铺满背景，男女声高亢对飙，鼓点强劲，情感达到顶峰\n\nVerse 2:\n节奏保持稳健，加入轻微的贝斯律动，两人交替演唱，增加互动感\n\nPre-Chorus:\n乐器暂时收缩，仅保留钢琴与弦乐，为副歌的再次爆发积蓄能量\n\nChorus:\n第二次副歌加入更多层次的电吉他琶音，和声更加丰满，整体声场宏大\n\nBridge:\n乐器留白，仅剩钢琴与沙哑男声的低语，随后女声以高音长调切入，迅速推向高潮\n\nFinal Chorus:\n最强音量，加入宏大的弦乐组与失真吉他Solo，男女声合唱展现极致的张力\n\nOutro:\n乐器逐渐淡出，仅留下一段清脆的钢琴尾音，伴随最后一声沙哑的叹息\n\n**Production:**\n整体制作风格：高保真的现场感，强调乐器的真实质感\n鼓组质感：厚重、扎实的真实鼓组，Snare 带有明显的空间感\n低频与贝斯：温暖且深沉，支撑起整首歌的骨架\n吉他 / 钢琴 / 弦乐 / Synth 质感：失真吉他带有温暖的电子管味道，弦乐真实且大气\nVocal 在混音中的位置：人声靠前，清晰且具有压迫感\nStereo Width：宽广，营造出开阔的听觉空间\nReverb / Delay：适度使用 Hall Reverb，增加情感的延伸感\n动态范围：极大，从极静到极动形成鲜明对比\n\n**Avoid:**\nEDM元素、Trap节奏、过多的合成器音色、过度修音、机械感强的鼓点、Rap片段"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 82, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [87], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [335.28955078125, 473.9073486328125], "pos": [3236.979736328125, 1724.6546630859375], "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n\n[Verse 1]\n(男) 凌晨三点的月光 还是那么冷\n(男) 烟灰缸里堆满 没说出口的余温\n(女) 窗外城市的灯火 模糊了视线\n(女) 我们像两粒尘埃 隔着银河在沉沦\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n(男) 越想用力握紧 越是感觉到痛\n(女) 那些承诺像泡沫 一触就破碎成空\n(合) 任凭寂寞在胸口 肆意地翻涌\n\n[Chorus]\n(合) 既然爱到撕心裂肺 为什么还要挽留\n(合) 这一场狂野的梦 谁先放手谁就输了所有\n(合) 你眼底的荒凉 刺痛我最后的温柔\n(合) 就让这绝望的旋律 陪我们坠入尽头\n\n[Verse 2]\n(女) 你总是沉默着 关上那扇心门\n(男) 我试着去解释 却只剩下满身伤痕\n(女) 是时间的错 还是我们太偏执\n(男) 连呼吸的节奏 都变得如此陌生\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n(女) 曾经并肩的誓言 如今都成了枷锁\n(男) 困住你我灵魂 谁也别想挣脱\n(合) 这一刻 谁又能比谁更难过\n\n[Chorus]\n(合) 既然爱到撕心裂肺 为什么还要挽留\n(合) 这一场狂野的梦 谁先放手谁就输了所有\n(合) 你眼底的荒凉 刺痛我最后的温柔\n(合) 就让这绝望的旋律 陪我们坠入尽头\n\n[Bridge]\n(男) 故事的结局 终究是各奔东西\n(女) 哪怕撕裂灵魂 也要留住最后的呼吸\n(合) 痛彻心扉的爱 是我们给彼此 最残忍的证明\n\n[Chorus]\n(合) 既然爱到撕心裂肺 为什么还要挽留\n(合) 这一场狂野的梦 谁先放手谁就输了所有\n(合) 你眼底的荒凉 刺痛我最后的温柔\n(合) 就让这绝望的旋律 为我们画上句点\n\n[Outro]\n(男) 终于还是散了\n(女) 散在风里\n(合) 消失在这一场 没能结局的梦里"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 85, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 63, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [64], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [480, 120], "pos": [1898.1656494140625, 870.1632690429688], "widgets_values": ["minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors", "minimax", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "id": 46, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors", "directory": "text_encoders", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/text_encoders/minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [65, 68], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}, {"name": "seconds", "links": [66], "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "size": [500, 750], "pos": [2428.165771484375, 700.1632690429688], "widgets_values": ["**Global Metadata:**\nPassionate Mandarin pop-rock power ballad with a cinematic and emotionally explosive sound. Around 82–86 BPM, minor-key verses with a dramatic uplifting harmonic lift in the chorus. The song should feel intense, desperate, fearless and cathartic, expressing two people standing at the edge of separation while one person refuses to let their love disappear without one final fight.\n\nThe emotional progression should begin tense and restrained, quickly build through the pre-chorus, then explode into a huge, memorable chorus. Each later chorus should become larger, more urgent and more emotionally overwhelming. The final chorus should feel like a complete emotional release, almost like shouting one's deepest feelings into the night.\n\n**Vocal Details:**\nPowerful adult female lead vocal with a rich mezzo-soprano tone, strong chest voice and a slightly husky emotional texture. Verses begin intimate and tense, with controlled breath and restrained emotion. Pre-choruses gradually introduce stronger projection and rising intensity.\n\nThe chorus should feature passionate high-register singing, powerful sustained notes, emotional vocal breaks, controlled rasp and dramatic phrasing. Key words at the end of chorus lines should be held longer with strong vibrato. The final chorus should contain the strongest vocal performance, with layered backing vocals and octave harmonies supporting the lead.\n\nNatural Mandarin pronunciation, emotionally raw but musically controlled. No cute or overly sweet vocal delivery.\n\n**Arrangement:**\nIntro begins with dark piano chords and distant atmospheric electric guitar, followed by a low cinematic pulse.\n\nVerse 1 uses piano, muted electric guitar, deep bass and minimal kick drum, creating tension and anticipation.\n\nPre-Chorus introduces rising toms, sustained strings and distorted guitar swells. The drums gradually become stronger, preparing for a sudden emotional lift.\n\nChorus explodes into full acoustic drums, powerful bass, wide distorted electric guitars, cinematic strings and bright piano chords. Crash cymbals emphasize the first beat of important phrases. The arrangement should feel huge, open and emotionally overwhelming.\n\nVerse 2 retains drums and bass but pulls the guitars slightly back to create contrast.\n\nThe second chorus becomes larger than the first, adding additional rhythm guitars, higher strings and subtle backing vocals.\n\nBridge drops suddenly into exposed piano and lead vocal for the first few lines, then gradually rebuilds with toms, strings and guitar feedback. The final line of the bridge should lead directly into an explosive final chorus.\n\nFinal Chorus reaches maximum intensity with full drums, layered distorted guitars, soaring strings, piano, backing vocals and octave harmonies. Add brief drum fills between vocal phrases and a final sustained vocal note near the end.\n\nOutro keeps distorted guitar sustain and piano while the drums gradually disappear, ending with one final unresolved emotional chord.\n\n**Production:**\nModern cinematic Mandarin pop-rock production, powerful acoustic drums, warm bass, wide electric guitars, emotional orchestral strings and clear piano. Vocal remains forward in the mix. Large stereo image, dynamic crescendos, strong but natural low end, dramatic plate reverb, tasteful delay throws on selected vocal phrases.\n\nAvoid EDM drops, trap beats, rap sections, excessive synthesizers or overly polished idol-pop production. The song should feel human, passionate, dramatic and physically powerful.\n", "[Intro]\n\n[Verse 1]\n风吹乱最后一个夜晚\n你站在离我一步之外\n那些没说出口的答案\n全都堵在我的胸口醒来\n\n你说我们已经走得太远\n再往前只剩彼此伤害\n可如果爱真的这么简单\n为什么眼泪还不肯停下来\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n别告诉我\n这一切只能算了\n别告诉我\n我们只能错过\n\n如果还有最后一分钟\n我宁愿把所有沉默都打破\n\n[Chorus]\n就让爱燃烧\n燃到整个世界都听到\n就算明天我们会失去所有\n今晚我也绝不放手\n\n就让爱燃烧\n烧掉那些软弱和骄傲\n如果这一生只能爱你一次\n我就爱到最后一秒\n\n不要转身\n不要逃跑\n不要让我们的故事\n停在这一秒\n\n就让爱燃烧\n就算最后只剩下心跳\n至少我曾用尽全部力气\n为你疯狂地爱过一场\n\n[Verse 2]\n我们也曾在人群里拥抱\n相信未来一定会来到\n是谁让承诺慢慢变安静\n是谁先学会假装不需要\n\n我不怕结局有多糟糕\n我只怕连争取都没做到\n如果爱注定留下伤痕\n那就让它刻得更深更牢\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n别告诉我\n时间会让人忘掉\n别告诉我\n离开才是最好\n\n如果心还会为彼此狂跳\n为什么现在就要认输逃跑\n\n[Chorus]\n就让爱燃烧\n燃到整个黑夜都破晓\n就算明天我们什么都没有\n今晚我也绝不放手\n\n就让爱燃烧\n烧掉所有距离和骄傲\n如果这一生只能爱你一次\n我就爱到最后一秒\n\n不要转身\n不要逃跑\n不要让我们的故事\n输给这一秒\n\n就让爱燃烧\n就算最后只剩下心跳\n至少我曾用尽全部力气\n为你疯狂地爱过一场\n\n[Bridge]\n如果你真的决定离开\n那就看着我的眼睛说出来\n\n告诉我\n你从来没有爱过\n告诉我\n那些拥抱都是假的\n\n如果你还能听见我的心跳\n如果你还有一秒舍不得\n\n那就回来\n\n回来——\n\n别让我们\n就这样结束\n\n[Chorus]\n就让爱燃烧\n燃到天空都为我们咆哮\n就算全世界都劝我放开你的手\n今晚我也绝不低头\n\n就让爱燃烧\n烧掉所有遗憾和煎熬\n如果这一生只能爱你一次\n我要让你永远都知道\n\n我没有逃\n我没有忘\n我曾为了你的名字\n和整个世界对抗\n\n就让爱燃烧\n燃到最后一滴眼泪落下\n哪怕故事最后没有答案\n我也不后悔爱你这一场\n\n[Outro]\n让它燃烧\n\n再燃烧\n\n直到天亮\n\n直到我们\n再也不能遗忘\n", 977800346805443, "fixed", 60.000000000000014, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption"